  "description": "Translation of error messages, success messages, labels and any other user-facing text a\n      service produces. The locale catalogue the platform ships (en, fr, de, ru, zh-Hans, hi, ar),\n      an embedded-JSON translation store that each assembly contributes to, CLDR plural selection,\n      and the ambient lookup used by the response envelope. The caller's locale comes from\n      IAuthorizationContext; this package only resolves text for a locale it is given.",
